msgid ""
"Add :meth:`Queue.shutdown <queue.Queue.shutdown>` and "
":exc:`~queue.ShutDown` to manage queue termination. (Contributed by "
"Laurie Opperman and Yves Duprat in :gh:`104750`.)"
msgstr ""
":meth:`Queue.shutdown <queue.Queue.shutdown>`\\과 "
